    dc:modified '2006-10-06T13:47:30'^^xsd:dateTime ;
    skos:altLabel ''^^xsd:string ;
    skos:prefLabel 'annual layer counting based on ion chromatography chemistry'@en ;
    skos:definition 'An ice core dating technique based on counting annual layers identified by chemical analysis.  The analytical technique used is a form of chromatography using a conductivity detector where a combination of weak ionic solvents are used to separate anions and cations of a solution, with the contribution of the solvent to conductivity suppressed just prior to detection.'@en ;
    skos:notation 'SDN:S04::S04384'^^xsd:string .
