<feed> tree:member <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/S04/current/S04204/1/> .
<http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/S04/current/S04204/1/>
    a skos:Concept ;
    dc:isVersionOf <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/S04/current/S04204/>;
    dc:modified '2006-10-02T18:26:59'^^xsd:dateTime ;
    skos:altLabel ''^^xsd:string ;
    skos:prefLabel 'high performance liquid chromatography (HPLC)'@en ;
    skos:definition 'A chromatographic technique for separating and analysing mixtures of substances, using a packed column containing microspheres coated with the stationary phase and where the mobile phase is pumped through the column with a high pressure pump. The emergence of each component of the sample under analysis from the column is monitored using one of a number of different detectors.'@en ;
    skos:notation 'SDN:S04::S04204'^^xsd:string .
<feed> tree:member <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/S04/current/S04204/1/> .
<http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/S04/current/S04204/1/>
    a skos:Concept ;
    dc:isVersionOf <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/S04/current/S04204/>;
    dc:modified '2006-10-02T18:26:59'^^xsd:dateTime ;
    skos:altLabel ''^^xsd:string ;
    skos:prefLabel 'chromatographie liquide haute performance (HPLC)'@en ;
    skos:definition 'A chromatographic technique for separating and analysing mixtures of substances, using a packed column containing microspheres coated with the stationary phase and where the mobile phase is pumped through the column with a high pressure pump. The emergence of each component of the sample under analysis from the column is monitored using one of a number of different detectors.'@en ;
    skos:notation 'SDN:S04::S04204'^^xsd:string .
<feed> tree:member <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/S04/current/S04204/1/> .
<http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/S04/current/S04204/1/>
    a skos:Concept ;
    dc:isVersionOf <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/S04/current/S04204/>;
    dc:modified '2006-10-02T18:26:59'^^xsd:dateTime ;
    skos:altLabel ''^^xsd:string ;
    skos:prefLabel 'high performance liquid chromatography (HPLC)'@en ;
    skos:definition 'Technique chromatographique visant à séparer et analyser des mélanges de substances en utilisant une colonne garnie contenant des microsphères enrobées d\'une phase stationnaire. La phase mobile est pompée au travers de la colonne à l\'aide d\'une pompe à haute pression. L\'émergence de chacune des composantes de l\'échantillon est examinée à l\'aide d\'un ou plusieurs détecteurs.'@en ;
    skos:notation 'SDN:S04::S04204'^^xsd:string .
<feed> tree:member <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/S04/current/S04204/1/> .
<http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/S04/current/S04204/1/>
    a skos:Concept ;
