    skos:prefLabel 'measurement of winch wire out'@en ;
    skos:definition 'The measurement of depth based on the wire deployed reading from a winch monitor. This assumes that the cable between ship and instrument is both taut and vertical, which is rarely the case in practice.'@en ;
