    dc:modified '2006-10-02T18:26:59'^^xsd:dateTime ;
    skos:altLabel ''^^xsd:string ;
    skos:prefLabel 'method of Yebra and Hernandez-Leon modified by Yebra et al. (2005)'@en ;
    skos:definition 'Determination of aminoacyl-tRNA synthethases in biota as described in Yebra, L., C. Almeida, S. Hernández-León (2005) Vertical distribution of zooplankton and active flux across an anticyclonic eddy in the Canary Island waters. Deep-Sea Res. I, 52:69-83.'@en ;
    skos:notation 'SDN:S04::S04374'^^xsd:string .
