    skos:prefLabel 'lowered acoustic doppler current profiler (ADCP)'@en ;
    skos:definition 'A type of current meter capable of simultaneous measurement of current velocity at a number of different depths based on determining Doppler shift of transmitted sound. Instrument mounted on a platform lowered through the water column to measure currents at depths out of acoustic range of the surface.'@en ;
    skos:notation 'SDN:S04::S0478'^^xsd:string .
